{
  "BT8-089": {
    "card": {
      "id": "BT8-089",
      "type": "LEADER",
      "colors": [
        "Black"
      ],
      "cost": null,
      "specified": null,
      "z": null,
      "power": 10000,
      "name": "Dr.Lychee & Hatchhyack",
      "characters": [
        "Dr.Lychee",
        "Hatchhyack"
      ],
      "traits": [
        "Scientist",
        "Ghost Warrior",
        "Machine Mutant"
      ],
      "skill": "[Permanent] You can only play black Battle Cards and this card can't attack.<br>[Auto] When a Battle Card attacks, the player who attacked can't attack with tokens or Battle Cards with energy costs of 7 or less other than the card they attacked with for the duration of the turn.<br>[Activate: Main][Once per turn] Place the top card of your deck under this card: Place the top card of your deck in your Drop Area, then draw 1 card.<br>[Awaken] If you only have black cards in your energy, choose 3 cards under this card and place them in their owners' Drop Areas: You may draw 1 card and flip this card over.",
      "backName": "Hatchhyack, Malice Assimilated",
      "backSkill": "[Permanent] You can only play black Battle Cards.<br>[Auto] When a Battle Card attacks, the player who attacked can't attack with tokens or Battle Cards with energy costs of 7 or less other than the card they attacked with for the duration of the turn.<br>[Auto] When this card attacks, this card gets +5000 power for the duration of the turn, and you draw 1 card."
    },
    "faq": [
      {
        "name": "Hatchhyack, Malice Assimilated",
        "qa": [
          {
            "q": "Can you play a Red/Black multicolor Battle Card when your Leader is this card?",
            "a": "Yes, you can."
          },
          {
            "q": "Can you play a Unison when your Leader is this card?",
            "a": "Yes, you can."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "BT1-091": {
    "card": {
      "id": "BT1-091",
      "type": "BATTLE",
      "colors": [
        "Yellow"
      ],
      "cost": "4",
      "specified": null,
      "z": null,
      "power": 15000,
      "name": "King Cold, Father of the Emperor",
      "characters": [
        "King Cold"
      ],
      "traits": [
        "Frieza Clan"
      ],
      "skill": "[Double Strike] <br>[Revenge] (When this card is attacked, KO the attacking card after the battle)<br>[Counter: Battle Card Attack] Play this card from your hand and change the target of the attack to this card.<br>[Auto] When you play this card, choose up to 1 opponent Battle Card and switch it to Rest Mode.",
      "backName": null,
      "backSkill": null
    },
    "faq": [
      {
        "name": "King Cold, Father of the Emperor",
        "qa": [
          {
            "q": "When activating the [Counter] skill of a Battle Card, can you activate it without paying the card\u2019s energy cost?",
            "a": "No, you must pay the energy cost.\n[Counter] skills can be activated from your hand by paying the card\u2019s energy cost."
          },
          {
            "q": "When playing cards with card skills, do you need to pay the energy cost of that card?",
            "a": "No, you do not need to pay unless specified otherwise."
          },
          {
            "q": "You used this card\u2019s [Counter: Battle Card Attack] to make this card the target of an attack. Can you KO the attacking card using [Revenge] at the end of the battle?",
            "a": "Yes, it does.\nRevenge activates when the card is attacked, or at the end of that battle, and KOs the opponent\u2019s card."
          },
          {
            "q": "You activated {BT1-107Cold Bloodlust} against {BT1-091King Cold, Father of the Emperor}\u2019s [Counter]. In this case, does the target of the attack still change?",
            "a": "Yes, it does."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
